Package: tika-mcp
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Your Name <you@example.com>
Installed-Size: 0
Depends: systemd
Recommends: default-jre-headless | java17-runtime-headless
Suggests: tesseract-ocr
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/your-org/tika-mcp
Description: Apache Tika MCP (Model Context Protocol) server
 tika-mcp exposes Apache Tika document processing capabilities
 as an MCP server, allowing LLM agents to extract text, metadata,
 and content-type information from over 1,000 document formats
 including PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PPTX, HTML, images (via OCR), and email.
 .
 Supported transports: stdio (for local MCP clients such as Claude
 Desktop) and HTTP (for remote or networked MCP clients).
 .
 Apache Tika server must be running and accessible; the recommended
 setup uses the companion tika.service unit also shipped in this package.
